      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mangata style:\n- Europe (west/north) but cosy\n- shade's style thingy\n- secret Mytvran cult thing\n\nWindheim style:\n- Dutch/West/Northern-European\n- Small Mytvran shrine\n\nEklundt style:\n- bricks and industrial shit idk\n- scaffolding\n- mines\n- farms\n\nWallenberg style:\n- spooky\n- DARK\n- gothic\n\nAmsele:\n- exotic\n- colorful!",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mangata style:\n- Europe (west/north) but cosy\n- shade's style thingy\n- secret Mytvran cult thing\n\nWindheim style:\n- Dutch/West/Northern-European\n- Small Mytvran shrine\n\nEklundt style:\n- bricks and industrial shit idk\n- scaffolding\n- mines\n- farms\n\nWallenberg style:\n- spooky\n- DARK\n- gothic\n\nAmsele:\n- exotic\n- colorful!",
